    {
      "id": "TNAfcbfvEMtOPGWIDhhrJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1542.746984919802,
      "y": -408.744192046504,
      "width": 1039.359375,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1596106234,
      "version": 106,
      "versionNonce": 1066883302,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780506634185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Qiymat taklifi (Value Proposition) - Shifokorlar xatolarini kamaytirish,\ndiagnostika tezligini oshirish va tibbiyot muassasalarida AI bilan ishlash\nmadaniyatini hamda etik standartlarini shakllantiruvchi yordamchi platforma. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Qiymat taklifi (Value Proposition) - Shifokorlar xatolarini kamaytirish,\ndiagnostika tezligini oshirish va tibbiyot muassasalarida AI bilan ishlash\nmadaniyatini hamda etik standartlarini shakllantiruvchi yordamchi platforma. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "i4q5ZxrxiF2MWa4crCNVs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1547.5321173553439,
      "y": -266.3381178492025,
      "width": 1024.967529296875,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 220530982,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 1251254586,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780506712764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mijozlar Segmenti - Xususiy va davlat klinikalari (shifokorlar ishi uchun).\nTibbiyot oliy ta'lim muassasalari (talabalar va professorlar uchun o'quv lab).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mijozlar Segmenti - Xususiy va davlat klinikalari (shifokorlar ishi uchun).\nTibbiyot oliy ta'lim muassasalari (talabalar va professorlar uchun o'quv lab).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "59-ITlIRxJu0GfanEnR8N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1556.7088406547232,
      "y": -161.9942734801549,
      "width": 884.435546875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 846574458,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1264543226,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780506821131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Daromad modellari:\n1. B2B (Klinikalar uchun): Har bir shifokor yuklangan rasmlar\nsoniga qarab oylik/yillik obuna (Software as Service).\n2. B2G / B2B (Universitetlar uchun): Tibbiy ta'lim kursi sifatida\nplatformaga litsenziya sotish.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Daromad modellari:\n1. B2B (Klinikalar uchun): Har bir shifokor yuklangan rasmlar\nsoniga qarab oylik/yillik obuna (Software as Service).\n2. B2G / B2B (Universitetlar uchun): Tibbiy ta'lim kursi sifatida\nplatformaga litsenziya sotish.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
