    {
      "id": "0XohnQPbTcmZsLu5T36bi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -782.4088149738237,
      "y": 505.2797459543091,
      "width": 659.7637939453125,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1237093030,
      "version": 1407,
      "versionNonce": 1366946746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780508348638,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1-Kun:\n    - G'oyani ishlab chiqish\n    - Researching\n    - Mantiqiy Tayyorgarlik va Arxitekturalash\n\n2-Kun:\n    - Git Tashkillashtirish va Kodlash.\n    - Research va tayyorgarlik\n    - AI modellarni o'qitish (traning)\n    - AI modellarni test qilish va correctness\n    - Web Interface Shablonlarini Shakillantirish\n    - 14:00 CheckPoint topshirish.\n    - Feedbacklar muxokamasi\n    - AI modellardan API chiqarish\n    - Backend Qurish\n    - Malumotlar Bazasi Shakillantirish\n    - Shablonlarni Bog'lash\n    - Frontend Funksionallik\n\n3-Kun:\n    ehtimol MVP tayyor bolar check pointgacha :)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1-Kun:\n    - G'oyani ishlab chiqish\n    - Researching\n    - Mantiqiy Tayyorgarlik va Arxitekturalash\n\n2-Kun:\n    - Git Tashkillashtirish va Kodlash.\n    - Research va tayyorgarlik\n    - AI modellarni o'qitish (traning)\n    - AI modellarni test qilish va correctness\n    - Web Interface Shablonlarini Shakillantirish\n    - 14:00 CheckPoint topshirish.\n    - Feedbacklar muxokamasi\n    - AI modellardan API chiqarish\n    - Backend Qurish\n    - Malumotlar Bazasi Shakillantirish\n    - Shablonlarni Bog'lash\n    - Frontend Funksionallik\n\n3-Kun:\n    ehtimol MVP tayyor bolar check pointgacha :)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
